    instructionAudio: {fileID: 0}
    repeatAudio: {fileID: 0}
    storyLines: []
    spellingQuestions:
    - word: Bed
      description: A bed is a piece of furniture used for sleeping and resting. It
        usually has a soft mattress supported by a frame and may include pillows,
        blankets, and sheets for comfort. Beds come in different sizes and styles
        and are commonly found in bedrooms at homes, hotels, hospitals, and other
        places where people sleep.
      descriptionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 582fee388b3391b45aeb608a0180562a, type: 3}
      instruction: Spell the word Bed
      instructionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6504d74a76c96940bec0322ee6aa72e, type: 3}
      helpMessage: Remember
      helpAudio: {fileID: 0}
      successMessage: Good Job! you spelled the word correctly
      successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91ff4162effae994c91ee49561b58c24, type: 3}
      letterWrongFeedback:
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter b is dot number 1 and 2
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59ef7e5353e19b74683838f724cd1c71, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 017737fb4ff3df244919b464613a0720, type: 3}
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter e is dot number 1 and 5
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ce62a7e2dc70c84a9c7c72eca115ab5, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 017737fb4ff3df244919b464613a0720, type: 3}
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter d is dot number 1, 4, and
          5
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6af2a8bfbba695e42ab57bdd7e8fb3e5, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2a7d0b4138ab53469a0df071710eed8, type: 3}
    - word: Keg
      description: A keg is a small barrel or container used to store and carry liquids,
        such as water or drinks. It is usually made of metal or wood and has a round
        shape.
      descriptionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf956c1948800c042bea7fd9f9df3d92, type: 3}
      instruction: Spell the word Keg
      instructionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6681ed5eaaa90aa4b88423b565a8b251, type: 3}
      helpMessage: Remember
      helpAudio: {fileID: 0}
      successMessage: Good Job! you spelled the word correctly
      successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91ff4162effae994c91ee49561b58c24, type: 3}
      letterWrongFeedback:
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter k is dot number 1 and 3
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4dbdfd38568649c4e956353ca4ce033d, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 017737fb4ff3df244919b464613a0720, type: 3}
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter e is dot number 1 and 5
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ce62a7e2dc70c84a9c7c72eca115ab5, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 017737fb4ff3df244919b464613a0720, type: 3}
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter g is dot number 1, 2, 4,
          and 5
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9ecedb98ec0b434f9064f451d0a6f0e, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9ecedb98ec0b434f9064f451d0a6f0e, type: 3}
    - word: Peg
      description: A peg is a small object used to hold, fasten, or hang things.
        It can be made of wood, plastic, or metal. People often use pegs to hang
        clothes on a clothesline, attach papers, or keep items in place.
      descriptionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a60191c7f53925941802e91b2a4fcbbc, type: 3}
      instruction: Spell the word Peg
      instructionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0daef3ee54bb8434f9ffd376ae63919c, type: 3}
      helpMessage: Remember
      helpAudio: {fileID: 0}
      successMessage: Good Job! you spelled the word correctly
      successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91ff4162effae994c91ee49561b58c24, type: 3}
      letterWrongFeedback:
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter p is dot number 1, 2, 3,
          and 4
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d70668145b56c240bcceb94914fb94a, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 017737fb4ff3df244919b464613a0720, type: 3}
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter e is dot number 1 and 5
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ce62a7e2dc70c84a9c7c72eca115ab5, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 017737fb4ff3df244919b464613a0720, type: 3}
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter g is dot number 1, 2, 4,
          and 5
        wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9ecedb98ec0b434f9064f451d0a6f0e, type: 3}
        correctMessage: Correct!
        correctAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2a7d0b4138ab53469a0df071710eed8, type: 3}
    - word: Leg
      description: A leg is a part of the body that helps people and animals stand,
        walk, run, jump, and move. Humans have two legs, and each leg is connected
        to a foot.
      descriptionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f7e92f7bb87fee248a05714e92d634b8, type: 3}
      instruction: Spell the word Leg
      instructionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2677ae08477163449a7992165fb01c49, type: 3}
      helpMessage: Remember
      helpAudio: {fileID: 0}
      successMessage: Good Job! you spelled the word correctly
      successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91ff4162effae994c91ee49561b58c24, type: 3}
      letterWrongFeedback:
      - wrongMessage: Remember the dot number for letter L is dot number 1, 2, and
